        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Baldwin DEL-TSR, Del Mar Handleset with Traditional Square Interior Trim</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Del Mar Handleset comes with a matching square rose for the interior trim, making it a great choice for contemporary homes. With its finger on the pulse of the hottest look in home décor, this front door handle is a popular choice for designers and homeowners alike. It is backed by a lifetime manufacture's warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. It is available in single, double, or dummy cylinder functions with any of 6 interior trim options and an array of beautiful finish choices so that you can select the best fit for your personal style and your needs. The Del Mar Handleset with Traditional Square Interior Trim will fit doors with thicknesses between 1-3/4 inches and 2-1/2 inches and it comes with an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Collection Del Mar Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Del Mar Entranceset with Square Rose Interior Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 16-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-8/9\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-19/32\" square</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Del Mar Handleset, Baldwin DEL-TSR",
                "description": "Baldwin DEL-TSR, Del Mar Handleset - The Del Mar Handleset comes with a matching square rose for the interior trim, making it a great choice for contemporary homes. With its finger on the pulse of the hottest look in home décor, this front door handle is a popular choice for designers and homeowners alike. It is backed by a lifetime manufacture's warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. It is available in single, double, or dummy cylinder functions with any of 6 interior trim options and 6 beautiful finish choices so that you can select the best fit for your personal style and your needs. The Del Mar Handleset with Traditional Square Interior Trim will fit doors with thicknesses between 1-3/4 inches and 2-1/2 inches and it comes with an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "BAL-DEL-TSR, Baldwin DEL-TSR, Del Mar Handlesets, Del Mar Front Door Handles, traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, rectangular handlesets, Baldwin Reserve Collection Del Mar Handlesets, Del Mar Entranceset with Square Rose Interior Trims,  Del Mar Handleset with Traditional Square Interior Trim,"
